# Per-unit gate count, the steppers/servo that move filament and select gates,
# and their speeds (the multi-unit entry point sources Kconfig.speeds itself)
# (Once user edits values here they are sticky and
# will override defaults)

menu "MMU Kinematics"
  help
    MMU Kinematics
    Number of gates, the gear stepper, selector stepper and selector servo,
    and movement speeds. Allows override of designer defaults. Change these
    settings if you know what you are doing (or have MMU customizations)

  if !MULTI_UNIT_ENTRY_POINT
    source "Kconfig.num_gates"
    source "Kconfig.gear_stepper"
    source "Kconfig.selector_stepper"
    source "Kconfig.selector_servo"
    source "Kconfig.speeds"
  endif
endmenu
